WEBVTT

00:07:56.621 --> 00:08:01.621
when I moved from being kind of the loud
party girl to, OK, this is scary,

00:08:01.621 --> 00:08:04.204
but I'm going to try to be the
smart kid. And that worked.

00:08:04.204 --> 00:08:11.746
And I was rewarded for it. Then I went
I moved solidly into a life of.

00:08:12.704 --> 00:08:20.871
Proving, performing, perfecting
until I actually physically

00:08:20.871 --> 00:08:26.788
and emotionally couldn't do it anymore,
and so I think, again,

00:08:26.788 --> 00:08:30.788
the big challenge of midlife is
the armor that we're carrying,